{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding"],"declarations":27,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.speedup_factor_restricted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.speedup_factor_restricted","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L148-L153","doc":"**Restricted-pair speedup** (assuming iZ ≤ iN convention):\n49/13 ≈ 3.77 reduction factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairsOrdered_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairsOrdered_card","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L144-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairsOrdered","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairsOrdered","kind":"def","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L139-L142","doc":"**Restricted pairs** with iZ ≤ iN (physical convention: N ≥ Z\nfor stable nuclei). Count: 13. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.speedup_factor_ordered","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.speedup_factor_ordered","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L131-L137","doc":"**Compute speedup factor (ordered pairs).** Replacing exhaustive\n7×7 grid search with the LR-compatible band reduces the work\nby a factor of 49/19 ≈ 2.58. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairs_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairs_card","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L124-L129","doc":"**Theorem (compute speedup).** The LR-compatible band has 19\nordered pairs out of 49 — both orderings (iZ, iN) and (iN, iZ)\nare included since the LR-fusion is non-commutative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.allShellPairs_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.allShellPairs_card","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L120-L122","doc":"**Theorem.** All 49 (iZ, iN) pairs in the 7×7 grid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.lrCompatiblePairs","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L114-L118","doc":"The set of (iZ, iN) pairs with |Δi| ≤ 1 — the\nLR-fusion-compatible band. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.allShellPairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.allShellPairs","kind":"def","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L109-L112","doc":"The set of all (iZ, iN) pairs in the 7×7 grid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture.compatible_iff_deltaI_le_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture.compatible_iff_deltaI_le_one","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L103-L103","doc":"The conjectural iff: LR-fusion is compatible iff `|Δi| ≤ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture.IsLRCompatible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture.IsLRCompatible","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L101-L101","doc":"Predicate: is the (iZ, iN)-shell pair LR-fusion-compatible\n(=> can support a doubly-magic isotope)? ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L98-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DeltaIBoundConjecture","kind":"class","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L91-L105","doc":"**Conjecture (Δi ≤ 1 bound).** For any (hypothetical or\nactual) doubly-magic isotope corresponding to Bring-shell index\npair `(iZ, iN)`, we have `|iN - iZ| ≤ 1`. The forward direction\nis proved on empirical data; the reverse — that no isotope\nwith `|Δi| ≥ 2` can be doubly-magic — is the framework\nprediction. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:double-magic-delta-i-bound","label":"conj:double-magic-delta-i-bound","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/double-magic-delta-i-bound.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.empirical_deltaI_in_zero_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.empirical_deltaI_in_zero_one","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L79-L87","doc":"**Theorem.** All 9 empirical doubly-magic isotopes have\n`Δi ∈ {0, 1}` (non-negative). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.empirical_deltaI_le_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.empirical_deltaI_le_one","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L69-L77","doc":"**Theorem (PROVED).** Every empirically observed doubly-magic\nisotope satisfies `|Δi| ≤ 1` (in fact, `Δi ∈ {0, 1}` since\nnuclei have N ≥ Z in stable cases). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.empiricalDoubleMagicIsotopes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.empiricalDoubleMagicIsotopes","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L54-L65","doc":"The 9 empirically observed doubly-magic isotopes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.deltaI","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.deltaI","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L50-L52","doc":"The empirical Δi for an isotope. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.N_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.N_eq","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L48-L48","doc":"N = magicAt iN. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.Z_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.Z_eq","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Z = magicAt iZ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iN_valid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iN_valid","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L44-L44","doc":"iN is a valid Bring shell index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iZ_valid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iZ_valid","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L42-L42","doc":"iZ is a valid Bring shell index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iN","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.iZ","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.N","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.Z","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/DoubleMagicDeltaI.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.name","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.DoubleMagicDeltaI.DoubleMagicIsotope.name